<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n110822" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φῐλαίτιος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>fond of bringing
				accusations, fault-finding, censorious,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Supp.</u>
				485
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PAmh.</u>
				2.65.22
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>; distd. from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φιλεπιτιμητής</span> by <i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				1.31
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πονηρὸν ὁ συκοφάντης . . καὶ φιλαίτιον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					18.242
				</span></i>
			; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐγνώμων,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Mem.</u>
				2.8.6
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῷ φ. τῆς ὐμελείας πέρι θεῶν</span>
			<i>fond of bringing charges</i> of neglect in their case, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				903a
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ φ.</span>”
				<i>censoriousness,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Sol.</u>
					25
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				2.813a
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ίως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Str.
					2.1.41
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				3.139
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>liable to censure,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
				10.70
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
